[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この揺れは……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This shaking...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物ね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A monster!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、頂獣でしょうか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "C-could it be an Apexi?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着け、天使ちゃん。\nヤツの縄張りは、もうちょっと先だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Calm down, little angel.\nIts territory is still a ways ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前ら！\u3000戦闘準備だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! Battle stations!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "了解！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かったわ！\u3000歓迎してやるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood! Let's give it a proper welcome!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、前にも言ったろ？\nヤツが現れる時には、かならず予兆があるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, like I told you before...\nThere are always signs before it appears."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣クヴァレルガ。ヤツは必ず、嵐と共に現れる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Apexi Kvarelga. It always appears with storms."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今からちょうど３年前――\n\u3000俺は果ての大陸を目指し船を出していた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Three years ago to this day—\nI set sail toward World's End.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（妻のバーバラや仲間たちを連れて、大陸から\n\u3000遥か北西……ちょうどこの海域を航海していた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(With my wife Barbara and our crew,\nwe sailed far northwest... through these very waters.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目的地は無数島群域だ。\nそれを取っ掛かりに果ての大陸を目指す！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our destination is the Infinite Island Chain.\nFrom there, we'll make our way to World's End!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣が出るって海域を突破する必要があるけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though we'll have to get through waters where the Apexi appears."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなヤツ、俺たちなら倒しちまえるさ！\nなぁ、船長！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! We can take down a beast like that!\nRight, Captain?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ったりめえだ。\nそのために、戦う備えだってしてきたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Damn right we can.\nThat's why we've prepared for battle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺らはいくつもの海を渡ってきた！\u3000\nどんな困難だって、全員で乗りきってきた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've crossed countless seas!\nWe've overcome every challenge together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たちなら、できる！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can do this!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおおおおっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "YEAHHH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だが、甘かった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But we were naive.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヤツは、嵐と共に現れた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It appeared with the storm.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわぁぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "AHHHHH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい！\u3000うわぁぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! AHHHHH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くそっ！！\u3000くそっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Damn it!! DAMN IT!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（高波は船から仲間たちを振り落とし、飲み込んだ。\n\u3000大砲の照準も定まらず、よしんば当たっても――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The massive waves threw my crew overboard and swallowed them.\nWe couldn't even aim the cannons, and even when we hit—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぜ、ぜんぜん効いてねえ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-it's not doing anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あああああああ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aaaaaaahhh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお……おオオ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhh... OHHH..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ、さっきから妙な声が……！\n周りの音が聞こえねえ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh, these strange voices...\nI can't hear anything else!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェ！\u3000ヤツが――！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze! It's—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（大砲の弾なんか通用しやしなかった。\n\u3000ヤツはとうとう船に半身を乗り上げてきた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The cannon fire did nothing.\nFinally, it raised its massive body onto our ship.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それは、高く壁となってそびえる恐怖と絶望だった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It towered over us like a wall of terror and despair.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだだ！\u3000負けねぇ！\nやられちまった仲間のためにも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not yet! I won't lose!\nFor the sake of our fallen crew!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぉぉぉぉぉっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "RAAAHHHHH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（俺たちは武器を手に必死に戦った。\n\u3000手応えがなくとも、やるしかなかった。が――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We fought desperately with our weapons.\nEven without making a dent, we had no choice but to fight. However—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何を――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what are you—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バ、バーバラ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "B-Barbara?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（俺を庇って直撃を受けたバーバラの姿を最後に……\n\u3000後のことはよく覚えちゃいない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The last I saw was Barbara taking the hit meant for me...\nI don't remember much after that.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（意識を取り戻した時、俺はすべてを失っていた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(When I came to, I had lost everything.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（バーバラとの思い出のペンダントと、仲間の証の\n\u3000短刀、そして、俺の命を残して）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(All that remained was the pendant Barbara and I shared,\nthe crew's ceremonial dagger, and my life.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんで、俺だけ……！\nバーバラ、みんな……俺を信じたばっかりに……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why just me...!\nBarbara, everyone... you trusted me and...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仇は――取るぜ。バーバラ、みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll avenge you—Barbara, everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "決着を付ける時が来たな、クヴァレルガ。\n首を洗って待ってやがれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The time for reckoning has come, Kvarelga.\nYou better be ready."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]